>>
endobj
510 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (The Dog Adoption Management System is a web-based application designed to simplify and manage the dog adoption process by connecting adopters, shelters/rescuers, and administrators through a single platform. It provides secure role-based login and separate dashboards for each user, ensuring that users can access only the information relevant to their role. The system allows adopters to browse available dogs, submit adoption applications, and track their application status, while shelters can manage dog listings and view applications for their own dogs.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
511 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (The application includes essential modules such as adopter registration, shelter/rescuer registration, dog profile management, adoption applications, adoption records, follow-up feedback, and adoption events. Automated workflows improve efficiency by sending email notifications, preventing duplicate applications, updating dog availability after approvals or rejections, and scheduling follow-up reminders after successful adoptions. These features help reduce manual work and ensure a transparent adoption process.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
512 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 394 0 R
/E (The system also provides powerful dashboards and reports for administrators, including statistics on total dogs, adoptions, pending applications, and upcoming follow-ups, along with graphical reports such as bar, line, and pie charts. Built with a clean, mobile-friendly interface using a warm orange and white theme, the Dog Adoption Management System promotes responsible pet adoption by creating a secure, organized, and user-friendly experience for all stakeholders.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
