667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 402 0 R
/E (The Dog Adoption Management System is a web-based application designed to simplify and manage the dog adoption process efficiently. It connects adopters, shelters/rescuers, and administrators through a single platform. The system allows adopters to browse available dogs, submit adoption applications, and track their application status.Shelters and rescuers can manage dog profiles, update health details, and view adoption requests, while administrators can verify users, approve dog listings, manage adoption records, and generate reports. The system also provides automated email notifications, follow-up reminders, and adoption event management. Overall, it reduces manual work, improves coordination, and promotes responsible dog adoption and animal welfare.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
