/E (The baseline used for comparison is a typical manual process for a small internal IT team; no separate legacy application or measured baseline was supplied. An employee reports a fault or requests equipment by email or message. IT staff identify the requester and equipment, enter or update a spreadsheet, coordinate approval, arrange allocation or repair, and later update the record. Managers request status summaries, which staff prepare by filtering or combining files. This process description is a project assumption used for analysis, not an audited description of a named organization. )
