/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 407 0 R
/E (Relevant trends include citizen development through visual builders, automation across record lifecycles, and AI-assisted application design. This project uses visual forms, reports and a dashboard together with Deluge and workflow configuration, which places it in the low-code category. No AI-generated feature or external analytics service is evidenced in the supplied export; AI and advanced analytics are therefore treated as possible extensions rather than implemented capabilities. )
