778 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (The proposed Dog Adoption Management System is a web-based application designed to simplify and improve the dog adoption process. It provides a centralized platform connecting adopters, shelters/rescuers, and administrators to manage dog profiles, user registrations, and adoption applications efficiently. Adopters can browse available dogs, submit adoption requests, and track their application status. Shelters and rescuers can add dog details, update health information, and manage adoption requests, while administrators can verify users, approve dog listings, and maintain adoption records. The system also provides automated email notifications, adoption status updates, post-adoption follow-up reminders, and adoption event management. Additionally, dashboards and reports help monitor adoption activities and improve decision-making. Overall, the proposed system reduces manual work, improves data accuracy, enhances communication, and promotes responsible dog adoption and animal welfare.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
