<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 413 0 R
/T (The system has three logical layers: \(1\) users access the application through the Creator web interface; \(2\) the application layer contains five forms, eight reports, a dashboard, workflows and Blueprint configurations; and \(3\) the Creator data layer stores form records and their lookup relationships. Deluge scripts and workflow actions operate within the application layer. The available export does not show a separate external integration layer. )
/E (The system has three logical layers: \(1\) users access the application through the Creator web interface; \(2\) the application layer contains five forms, eight reports, a dashboard, workflows and Blueprint configurations; and \(3\) the Creator data layer stores form records and their lookup relationships. Deluge scripts and workflow actions operate within the application layer. The available export does not show a separate external integration layer. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
