/T (The application is presented through the Zoho Creator web interface. Users navigate to forms to add or update records, reports to review records, grouped views to inspect status or category, and a dashboard for summary metrics. Form data is stored in the Creator application and linked through lookups to asset, employee and request records. The exported configuration defines Deluge email actions, a schedule and Blueprint stages. No external API, CRM or analytics connection is evidenced. )
