/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 414 0 R
/E (The project contains five forms. Asset records capture identification, category, manufacturer, model, serial number, purchase and warranty dates, cost, assignees, location and notes. Employee records capture identity, department, contact, role, active status, location, manager and department code. Asset Assignment records link assets and employees, with assignment and return details. IT Request records link requester and related asset and track priority, status, assigned staff and resolution. Maintenance Record links an asset and optionally an IT request, and records type, description, technician, status, cost and dates. The following table gives representative field specifications; the complete field set is in the supplied Creator export. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [33]
>>
