<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 421 0 R
/E (The exported application includes Deluge scripts in two automations. The asset- assignment form workflow checks whether an edited assignment has Returned status, retrieves the related employee and manager, and emails the manager when a manager email is present. The warranty schedule selects assets whose warranty end date falls within the next 30 days and emails assigned employees, falling back to the logged-in user when no employee email is available. The code excerpts summarize the exported logic; no separate validation script or API integration was found. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [31]
>>
endobj
