<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 439 0 R
/E (The Dog Adoption Management System is designed to simplify and improve the dog adoption process by providing a centralized platform for adopters, shelters/rescuers, administrators, and veterinary doctors. The system helps manage dog profiles, user registrations, adoption applications, medical records, and adoption details efficiently. It also provides automated notifications, follow-up reminders, feedback management, and adoption event tracking. By reducing manual work and maintaining accurate records, the system improves communication, saves time, and ensures better coordination among users. Overall, the project promotes responsible dog adoption, supports animal welfare, and helps dogs find safe and loving homes.)
/Pg 59 0 R
/K [5]
>>
