4162 0 obj
<<
/Title (The system has three logical layers: \(1\) users access the application through the Creator web interface; \(2\) the application layer contains five forms, eight reports, a dashboard, workflows and Blueprint configurations; and \(3\) the Creator data layer stores form records and their lookup relationships. Deluge scripts and workflow actions operate within the application layer. The available export does not show a separate external integration layer.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4151 0 R
/Prev 4172 0 R
>>
