/Title (The five forms capture the core data. Asset and Employee are master records. Asset Assignment links an asset to one or more employees and stores assignment status and dates. IT Request links the requester and related asset and captures issue details, priority and resolution. Maintenance Record links an asset and request and records maintenance type, technician, status, cost and completion. The exported .ds file defines text, picklist, date, currency, list/lookup, name, email, checkbox, phone, date-time and textarea fields. The screenshots show the visible form layouts and sample register data.)
